WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:34.440
Sana!

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:36.200
Blackboard erasers?

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:40.950
Wait a minute... blackboard
erasers, blackboard erasers...

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:45.040
The blackboard eraser stock is
stored in the storage room.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:49.000
The person who suggested to have the clubroom in the North Wing was Nakao!

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.710
Oh, that's right!

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.590
Yeah! The North Wing!
You realized too late!

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.720
Sana-chan and the others are in
trouble! Hurry! Hurry!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.640
- It won't open!
- Sensei, do you have the key?

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.260
Even if we had the key, the door is stuck.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.640
Nakao, are you there?

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.140
- Akito-kun!
- Sana-chan!

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:07.770
We're here!

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:12.900
Hurry! Help Nakao and Sana!

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:19.780
Sana! Sana! Everyone came!

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.990
Nakao! Nakao!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:26.160
We're saved...

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:27.660
We're saved...

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.420
Sana! Cheer up!

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.800
Akito-kun, you're bleeding!

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.180
- It's nothing.
- Come with me, hurry.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:47.520
Suzuki-sensei and Sengoku-sensei,
please go with them.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.690
We'll contact their guardians and
join you as soon as possible.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:51.730
Yes!

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:00.410
Sensei! Ouch!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.780
- What are you doing here?
- Sorry.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.870
- How is Sana?
- There were no heavy injuries...

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.290
You should watch my daughter.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.250
Mama.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.420
Please leave the two of us.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.760
Ok...

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.510
Are you ok?

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.560
I failed...

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:31.640
I see.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:38.990
I thought it was right so I did it...
starting a karate club but...

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.610
I failed...

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:45.580
I don't know the circumstances but
I guess it's true.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:54.330
Mama! Could you hold me?
I can't cry for Hayama.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.000
That's fine.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:04.970
Akito...

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.390
Are you alright?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.510
Yeah.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.020
I see.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.650
Sana-chan was also with you?

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:22.860
She looked... alright as well.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:26.320
I see, I'm glad.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.830
Nakao...

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.160
Nakao is...

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.460
...your friend?

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.130
I have a favor to ask you.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.260
You don't
need to worry about Nakao.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:54.600
But he seems to be very weak so it will take some time for him to regain consciousness.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.730
I see.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.190
I'm glad.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.400
- Everyone...
- Oh, I cut work!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.900
- Please go back to your homes.
- But... anyway, everyone's ok.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.620
It's late. Suzuki-sensei please
guide them.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:08.780
Yes.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.330
- Sorry for intruding.
- Sensei...

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.370
I'm really sorry.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:22.000
From the start I have laid my eyes on Hayama Akito's dangers.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:28.260
I have put on this fact against the school many times, but they never accept it.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:33.640
And now it has come to this present state.
I didn't have the power to stop it.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.140
It's not your fault, Sensei.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.020
You don't have to apologize.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:40.860
But now the school must decide
on his expelling.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:44.820
He will definitely be pushed
into that state.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.870
Mr. Hayama, right?

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.870
I assume Akito was concerned about Nakao-kun's health.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:02.840
Oh I see, so he's using his
father. How great of him.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.760
You don't even know what your own
child was doing to Nakao.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:15.220
Hayama Akito's expelling will have result soon, this time you must be prepared.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.060
Did I use the wrong way to well
this to you?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.690
Oh, you're here.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:27.700
Yeah.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.410
You don't have to worry about
Nakao-kun.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:36.660
Fuka and the others told me just now, his consciousness hasn't come back yet.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:38.710
I see.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.420
I...

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:49.380
never thought much about people like Nakao-kun.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:55.470
A thing like that happens, and
they think they have no meaning in life.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.850
I don't get it.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.640
No.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.520
I'm just like him.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:10.200
Do I have a meaning in life?

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:16.120
I'm sick of life,
everything is so annoying.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.790
That time...

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:22.250
If you weren't there,
maybe I would have...

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:23.710
Hayama...

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.510
You were by my side.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.680
But Nakao...

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.850
...had no one to tell him that.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:42.310
The scenery makes people sad.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.860
I don't know what else to think about.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:50.320
I was thinking those kind of
boring things while I was walking.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:56.450
I still have drifting thoughts, we
only could do was go back to our homes.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:01.210
What are we supposed to do in this
kind of situation?

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:04.920
What can we do?

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:13.760
Akito, I think I'm going to pooch
Sengoku-sensei.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:20.060
But I'll hold myself back because
father is an adult.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:25.690
Akito, do you want to change
schools?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.860
I'm prepared but...

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:39.160
The doctor said that you could come
home, what are you going to do?

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:45.420
I want to stay here until
Nakao-kun regains his consciousness.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.960
Alright, let's do that.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.710
That night was long.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:59.390
No one said anything...

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:04.390
but I was sitting next to Hayama most of time.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.200
Shouta!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:16.240
Nakao is back to normal!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.950
Oh, is that so?

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.830
Sagami-kun, go tell those two the news.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:22.910
Yes!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.290
- Really?
- Yes.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.040
I'm glad!

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.880
- Right, Hayama?
- Yes.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.880
It'll be alright now. He will gain
strength back soon.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:41.680
But I want to do this little by little
so please no meetings with him.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.810
Thank you very much.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:48.730
Um... can I come back now?
Now it seems I can finally come.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:52.900
I'm so relieved! It's great.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.070
Sana's not here yet.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:58.990
Yeah, maybe everyone is still at the hospital.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.410
Excuse me.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.120
Huh? No one's here.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.410
Sengoku-sensei's not here either.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.130
Ah, Matsui-san, what's wrong?

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:13.210
Ah, Yousaki-sensei, our first
period is Sengoku-sensei's so...

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:15.880
Oh, he got a message from
Kyoto-sensei.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:19.140
Nakao-kun regained consciousness
so everything will be alright.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.260
The teachers will come back soon.

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.510
Ah, Nakao kun is back to normal?

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.020
Yes. So do self-study
until he comes back.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.430
Yes! I got it!

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.230
See you at gymnastics!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.860
I see! Nakao's back to normal.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.900
I'll go tell everyone!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.420
Um...

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:07.270
Shouta would like to speak to guys.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.490
I had a dream.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:26.410
Inside the dream, I died.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:33.790
At first I wanted Sengoku-sensei to realize it.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.340
And then...

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.800
That's why you wrote
the letter to Sengoku-sensei?

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:47.810
Inside my dream,
I died and thought: "Oh, I died".

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:51.690
But I could hear Kurata-san's voice.

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:56.900
Saying we have 40 cubic meters
left in our lives.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.860
You were crying, Kurata-san.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:07.410
And then I suddenly had an urge to live.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:12.830
I'm dead but, no. Why did I die?

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:20.460
I didn't do anything, I became
reluctant, I was mad about my death.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:26.470
When I got back to normal and I realized I was alive, I was really happy.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:29.810
So since I'm alive...

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:33.140
I want to do something.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:38.070
Um... I want to continue Karate Club.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:42.740
I want to do it with Hayama-kun!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.610
Hayama...

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:48.620
Me too, I'm just like you.

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:53.750
I wanted a proof that I'm alive
and I started karate.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.460
Let's do Karate together.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:04.130
Thank you. I can do it, right?

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:09.640
Yeah. You're strong.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:20.400
What the hell is this?
It's too hard on him!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:24.530
Nakao Shouta-kun who had
disappeared from 2 days ago,

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.820
has been recovered...

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.490
Matsui!

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.450
Come here for a minute.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.490
Fuka-chan.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:33.950
What's going on?

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:37.620
In the conference room, the teachers are talking about Nakao-kun right now.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:42.500
And it seems that Sengoku-sensei
attacking on Akito-kun.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:46.800
Since Nakao has that letter,
Hayama-san is in trouble now.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:50.510
We were talking about going into
the conference room to defend him.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.560
Fuka-chan, can you come?

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.430
If you come then we'll have a strong person!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:58.270
You guys!
Wait for me until I come back!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.770
- Huh?!
- Got it?! You guys wait!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.190
Fuka-chan!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:08.910
Why does he do this?!
Why does he have to be so dirty?!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.450
- Ahh! Akito! Are you alright?
- Ooh, Natsumi.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.870
What happened?!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.170
You guys didn't come back last night so...

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:21.000
You have a bandage wrapped around
your head! Here, change into this!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.130
Are you sure you're alright?
Answer me.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.050
- I didn't have a chance to answer you.
- Don't think it is easy.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.170
Excuse me, we're borrowing this room!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.840
I wonder what's gonna happen next.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:37.020
I was thinking of the Karate Club and
going to the same high school as Hayama.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:42.560
But Nakao's words make me want to stay at Jinbo Middle School.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.020
At this rate...

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:48.650
Fuka!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:52.950
Please help me right now.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.790
This incident with Nakao,
I have predated it.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:03.460
I have warned you all about the
dangers of Hayama many times.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:08.920
But with these overly optimistic thoughts of the school, it was injured often.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.470
Are you saying I am overly optimistic?

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.220
Isn't that the truth?

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.350
This time Nakao was safe
so it was alright

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:18.980
but Hayama will definitely bring
on bigger chaos.

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:23.650
We do not know that this incident
is directly involving Hayama,

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.480
we must research it more.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:28.690
I have a letter written by
Nakao in my hands right now!

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.860
What is the need to research?!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.700
The thing I was most disappointed about

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:36.330
was that Sengoku-sensei didn't realize I was absent from school.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.410
What the?

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:45.590
When you questioned if I was in your class I thought that I was not a living being.

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:51.050
Sensei, you didn't care about me!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:56.510
I always liked you and admired you.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.430
What are you doing, Matsui? Stop it!

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.850
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?
Listen!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:06.480
What else do I have, Sensei?

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:12.450
Do I have a meaning in life?
I was always thinking about that.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:16.160
So please help me, Sensei.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:23.540
That letter was shoved in between
a book of Sengoku-sensei.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.500
It's a continuation of the letter
he has in his hands!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.380
I don't know anything about this!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.340
Why didn't you get rid of this letter, Sensei?

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:34.050
Why did I have to find it?!

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:37.550
Go back to your classroom!
This isn't a place for kids to talk!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:40.810
Matsui-san, please let me see
that letter.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:41.730
Principal!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.480
Sengoku-sensei,

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:48.270
Nakao-kun is going to continue doing Karate club with us.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:54.320
Nakao-kun said that he really wanted to be saved by you Sengoku-sensei, but...

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:58.530
That letter didn't say anything
about places. How would I save him?

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:03.210
So you're saying you have read
that letter.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:10.840
Nakao-kun asking for help... It seems that you missed it, Sengoku-sensei.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.300
We kids...

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:18.430
always think about adults in our mind.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:22.060
The society that adults have just
created carelessly

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:26.140
we're trying to change
in our own childish ways.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:30.730
So get yourself together, adult!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:38.490
We can't choose adults.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:47.960
And so Sengoku-sensei resigned before spring and decided to leave the school.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.210
That's a shame.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:57.340
But Principal, I do not think that my beliefs are wrong.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:01.890
A human being that committed a mistake once will not easily come back up.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:08.400
Maybe adults are like that.
But children are not.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:13.480
They have the time and power to
make up for it.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:17.950
Let's meet again, Sengoku-sensei.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.160
Nakao...

